{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022010009437-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022120554\"/><p>遇襲男子負傷往醫院求診。</p><p>將軍澳發生傷人案。昨日(21日)晚上11時許，一名姓曾(35歲)男子，頭及手部受傷負傷往將軍澳醫院求醫，他報稱在駿日街遭人斬傷。警員接報抵院及往現場搜證，經初步調查後，相信曾男在上址對開被3名案發時身穿黑色上衣、黑色長褲及戴口罩男子以牛肉刀襲擊，案件列作「傷人」，正追緝涉案人士。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:22:43.322731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:18:18.142340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:18:18.142340+00:00","content_hash":"c11724c0cfc0e7f6168b31cf5a1478ad22b582c3e8ea739570456c00905a4742","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}